{"name":"Fulvous","hex":"#e48400","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"fulvous","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Tawny-colored."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fulvous"}],"entries":[{"title":"Fulvous","blocks":[{"text":"Fulvous is a colour, sometimes described as dull orange, brownish-yellow or tawny; it can also be likened to a variation of buff, beige, or butterscotch. As an adjective it is used in the names of many species of birds, and occasionally other animals, to describe their appearance. It is also used as in mycology to describe fungi with greater colour specificity, specifically the pigmentation of the surface cuticle, the broken flesh and the spores en masse."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fulvous","wikidata":"Q5508507"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Lanio_fulvus_-_Fulvous_Shrike-Tanager_%28male%29%3B_Botanic_Garden%2C_Manaus%2C_Amazonas%2C_Brazil.jpg/500px-Lanio_fulvus_-_Fulvous_Shrike-Tanager_%28male%29%3B_Botanic_Garden%2C_Manaus%2C_Amazonas%2C_Brazil.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Lanio_fulvus_-_Fulvous_Shrike-Tanager_%28male%29%3B_Botanic_Garden%2C_Manaus%2C_Amazonas%2C_Brazil.jpg/1280px-Lanio_fulvus_-_Fulvous_Shrike-Tanager_%28male%29%3B_Botanic_Garden%2C_Manaus%2C_Amazonas%2C_Brazil.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Lanio_fulvus_-_Fulvous_Shrike-Tanager_%28male%29%3B_Botanic_Garden%2C_Manaus%2C_Amazonas%2C_Brazil.jpg/500px-Lanio_fulvus_-_Fulvous_Shrike-Tanager_%28male%29%3B_Botanic_Garden%2C_Manaus%2C_Amazonas%2C_Brazil.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Fulvous shrike-tanager","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALanio_fulvus_-_Fulvous_Shrike-Tanager_(male)%3B_Botanic_Gar